fold|fold
comm|comm
paste|paste [-d LIST] FILE...
pgrep|pgrep PATTERN
pidof|pidof NAME
killall|killall NAME
killall5|killall5 -SIG
pkill|pkill PATTERN
grep|grep [-EFivwcnrl] PATTERN [FILE]
ip|ip addr|link|route ...
bashdhcp|DHCPv4 client (RFC2131 DISCOVER/OFFER/REQUEST/ACK + parse-message)
nice|nice [-n N] CMD
nohup|nohup CMD
link|link TARGET NAME
blkid|blkid [DEV]
lsblk|lsblk
diff|diff A B
ss|ss [-tuln]
netstat|netstat -tuln (via ss backend)
ping|ping [-c N] HOST
